WEBVTT

00:00:07.958 --> 00:00:09.042
"Magami Academy"

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.042
Goodbye! Go straight home now.

00:00:12.042 --> 00:00:13.708
--Yes, ma'am.
--Yes, ma'am. See you later, Miss Alucard.

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:15.458
--See ya.
--Bye!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.708
Product of Yamanashi...

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:35.958
Looks to be a stormy night.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.833
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:48.958
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:56.333
<i>We exchanged promises...</i>

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.042
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:03.875
<i>...under the moonlight</i>

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:08.792
<i>At midnight, whispering like a roar</i>

00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:14.250
<i>In the silence and bustle of your current situation</i>

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:19.375
<i>Do you feel like you're gonna go crazy and break?</i>

00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:23.292
<i>But live your own way, yeah, like you are</i>

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:27.208
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:32.417
<i>Let's not be chameleons</i>

00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:37.542
<i>But change ourselves from the inside</i>

00:01:37.542 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>I can hear those words</i>

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:47.792
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will break all nights</i>

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:51.458
<i>Gently and furiously</i>

00:01:51.458 --> 00:02:03.042
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will rip apart all nights</i>

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:44.000
Lady Aoi...

00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:47.708
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:48.875
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Eleventh Night"

00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:50.875
"Scattered Blossoms, Divergent Lives"

00:02:52.292 --> 00:02:55.375
Hello? What?

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.125
Aoi's disappeared?!

00:02:57.125 --> 00:02:59.250
I'll give you the details later.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.000
I made sure to tell Daigo too.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.458
Listen, Kozunu's on the move. Be on your guard.

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:07.458
Kozunu? What the heck is going on here?!

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:09.333
Is Aoi all right? What about Kisaragi?

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:10.583
Shut up!

00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:12.500
Just look for her!

00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:22.792
Ah, there you are!

00:03:22.792 --> 00:03:25.375
Sheesh, I've been looking all over for you!

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:28.542
I don't have the damn time to be playin'
your little newspaper game with you.

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:30.167
What do you mean "game"?!

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:34.375
And it's not about that! Here, look at this!

00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:37.667
It was just her arm at first, but...

00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:40.625
Hey, you don't think this could mean...

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:55.458
No... No, I'm fine.

00:03:55.458 --> 00:03:56.625
Bye.

00:03:58.542 --> 00:04:02.542
My uncle says something came up,
so he can't come get me.

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:05.792
Oh yeah? What will you do then?

00:04:05.792 --> 00:04:09.667
There are no more buses running either.
Guess we'll have to walk.

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:23.625
I'm sorry.

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:43.333
What's the matter?

00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:48.917
Nothing! It's nothing really.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.625
These are...

00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:11.708
...sweet peas?

00:05:11.708 --> 00:05:13.333
Pretty, aren't they?

00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:14.583
Yeah...

00:05:14.583 --> 00:05:19.083
There are lots of sweet pea farms around here.

00:05:19.083 --> 00:05:22.667
Nothing here has changed since back then.

00:05:22.667 --> 00:05:26.708
Back then, I was here with my mom and dad.

00:05:30.042 --> 00:05:33.500
Same with me, my parents also...

00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:40.333
I have a key ring too.

00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:57.375
Someday I plan to have a farm like this,
and grow lots and lots of sweet peas.

00:05:57.375 --> 00:05:58.917
Hey, Hiyu?

00:05:58.917 --> 00:05:59.958
Yeah?

00:06:00.792 --> 00:06:04.042
When that time comes, why don't we...

00:06:56.292 --> 00:06:58.792
--Kisaragi!
--Kisaragi!

00:07:05.792 --> 00:07:07.292
Is this it?

00:07:07.292 --> 00:07:08.458
Yeah...

00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:14.125
Well...

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.000
It's all right.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.792
Huh? Oh, then...

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:29.958
Hiyu...

00:07:34.292 --> 00:07:38.042
It's pretty late, so if you like...

00:07:38.042 --> 00:07:39.125
Sure.

00:08:05.833 --> 00:08:07.625
Have you gotten any word from Kyouichi?

00:08:07.625 --> 00:08:08.958
No.

00:08:10.292 --> 00:08:13.125
Where could Misato be?

00:08:13.125 --> 00:08:15.833
She is already in Kozunu's hands.

00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:17.792
What did you say?

00:08:17.792 --> 00:08:19.458
What is going on here?!

00:08:19.458 --> 00:08:21.500
Why has Aoi been taken away by him?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:25.125
What the heck is the deal?
And what the heck are you doing here?

00:08:25.125 --> 00:08:26.458
Hey! I'm talking to you!

00:08:26.458 --> 00:08:29.250
Sakurai, calm down!

00:08:30.917 --> 00:08:32.375
Kisaragi...

00:09:05.917 --> 00:09:06.917
Misato?

00:09:06.917 --> 00:09:08.000
Aoi!

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.083
Stop!

00:09:09.083 --> 00:09:11.208
What's the matter with you?

00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:13.292
Take a good look.

00:09:13.292 --> 00:09:14.375
Huh?

00:09:23.458 --> 00:09:25.542
Go! Step on it, Azumabashi!

00:09:25.542 --> 00:09:28.417
You got it, Boss!

00:09:28.417 --> 00:09:29.708
Tatsuma...

00:09:31.292 --> 00:09:33.333
Aoi?

00:09:33.333 --> 00:09:34.792
Lady Aoi!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:39.750
Lady Aoi...

00:10:09.333 --> 00:10:12.583
Kisaragi, what the heck is this?

00:10:12.583 --> 00:10:15.292
Stop her. Stop Lady Aoi!

00:10:19.667 --> 00:10:21.292
The Demoniacal Horde?!

00:10:21.292 --> 00:10:27.458
I don't exactly get it, but he told
me to go get him that dirty thing.

00:10:33.583 --> 00:10:35.042
It's no use.

00:10:37.458 --> 00:10:43.458
Sucks for you, you were that close
to getting yourself a cute girlfriend.

00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:45.958
But I'm afraid not.

00:10:49.125 --> 00:10:53.500
This woman isn't alive. She's deceased.

00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:31.292
She's a corpse demon.

00:11:31.292 --> 00:11:34.417
Yeah, she died a while ago.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.583
Look...

00:11:42.792 --> 00:11:45.792
This is what she really looks like.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:52.500
I gave her life, but it was only a temporary thing.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:56.167
There's no blood running through her,
and her flesh and bones keep on rotting.

00:11:56.167 --> 00:12:00.958
She sold you out so that
she could regain her own life.

00:12:00.958 --> 00:12:05.958
He said he'd bring my mom
and my dad back to life too.

00:12:05.958 --> 00:12:08.625
He said he'd bring everyone back.

00:12:08.625 --> 00:12:10.792
So... So...

00:12:12.833 --> 00:12:16.458
I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

00:12:16.458 --> 00:12:17.708
I knew it.

00:12:17.708 --> 00:12:19.083
Huh?

00:12:19.083 --> 00:12:20.250
Huh...?

00:12:27.333 --> 00:12:29.000
I knew it all along.

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:38.542
I really don't like you at all.
Nothing fazes you, huh?

00:12:38.542 --> 00:12:41.167
That face of yours makes me sick.

00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:52.708
I'll tell you something: the girl is mine now.

00:12:52.708 --> 00:12:55.125
And right about now, your friends are also...

00:12:55.125 --> 00:12:56.417
Misato?!

00:12:56.417 --> 00:13:00.125
There you go, now <i>that's </i>the face I wanted to see.

00:13:00.125 --> 00:13:02.958
It was my intention just to
have you keep tabs on him,

00:13:02.958 --> 00:13:06.333
but you were helpful in
getting him away from the girl.

00:13:06.333 --> 00:13:09.792
You put on a wonderful show, my little pretty.

00:13:09.792 --> 00:13:13.000
The only thing left is you.

00:13:21.417 --> 00:13:24.000
Who the hell are you?

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:28.458
You've really gotten on my nerves,
you little pain in the ass.

00:13:31.083 --> 00:13:35.458
Now you will tell me the truth about yourself.

00:14:13.583 --> 00:14:14.792
This is...

00:14:28.375 --> 00:14:31.167
Who... Who is this?!

00:14:48.042 --> 00:14:50.625
M-Manabu... You...

00:14:50.625 --> 00:14:56.542
Wrong! Wrong, I am Kozunu!

00:14:56.542 --> 00:15:00.000
Tendo Kozunu!

00:15:07.833 --> 00:15:14.583
I get it... Now I understand why
I was so concerned about you.

00:15:14.583 --> 00:15:18.375
You... Your people are...

00:15:24.375 --> 00:15:25.792
Die...

00:15:28.292 --> 00:15:31.208
Die!

00:15:45.042 --> 00:15:46.417
I am grateful,

00:15:46.417 --> 00:15:50.500
grateful that we were
fated to run into each other!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.625
Stop it!

00:16:08.625 --> 00:16:10.500
Please stop this!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:15.417
Please, I don't care what
happens to me! So please...

00:16:29.375 --> 00:16:34.125
If you've really gotten to like him so much,
then go to the other side together.

00:16:39.125 --> 00:16:42.167
Don't look... Don't look at me!

00:16:44.375 --> 00:16:46.583
This is the end!

00:16:47.833 --> 00:16:49.083
You little!

00:16:59.708 --> 00:17:02.250
The balance between sun and moon has been...

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.042
Why you little bitch!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.208
Hirasaka!

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.292
Hiyu...

00:17:22.167 --> 00:17:23.500
Hiyu...

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:28.583
The sweet peas... Let's both... Let's...

00:17:42.917 --> 00:17:46.208
Focus your minds! Do not listen to their song!

00:17:46.208 --> 00:17:47.667
This is a curse!

00:18:08.625 --> 00:18:11.083
You don't know when to die.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.750
Kozunu... Kozunu!

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.458
Tendo!

00:18:37.625 --> 00:18:39.792
You... Why you...

00:18:39.792 --> 00:18:44.750
You're the one! Because of you,
the Kozunu family, my mother...

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.667
You... You killed my mother!

00:18:52.625 --> 00:18:55.292
Give my mother back.

00:18:56.333 --> 00:19:02.667
Give my mother back!

00:19:30.333 --> 00:19:34.917
Sakurai... Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:19:36.583 --> 00:19:40.292
--Sakurai, hang in there!
--Tenma gedo kaibusho shima sansho chodorai.

00:19:40.292 --> 00:19:44.000
Makai bukkai dojori, isso byodo mushabetsu.

00:19:45.417 --> 00:19:47.292
Even the Netherworld Hymn is of no use.

00:19:47.292 --> 00:19:49.125
Yet more evidence of
the Bodhisattva Eye's power?

00:19:49.125 --> 00:19:51.792
Aoi!

00:19:54.167 --> 00:19:56.792
Good grief, <i>still </i>not done?

00:19:56.792 --> 00:19:59.417
Hurry up and finish this.

00:20:12.583 --> 00:20:13.750
Who are you?!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.250
Umon... Raito Umon!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:20.458
You guys are goofing off as usual, I see.

00:20:20.458 --> 00:20:22.750
Hey, short 'n ugly!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:25.292
You're not supposed to be out this late, kid!

00:20:25.292 --> 00:20:30.625
Why you... You mohawk-headed freak!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.333
Well, now, not too shabby, short 'n ugly.

00:20:36.333 --> 00:20:39.375
One more of you doesn't make any difference.

00:20:45.708 --> 00:20:47.292
What the heck's going on?

00:20:47.292 --> 00:20:48.667
It stinks of incense!

00:20:48.667 --> 00:20:50.042
Lady Komaki!

00:20:51.458 --> 00:20:54.500
Please withdraw now!

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.208
Hinano? B-But...

00:20:57.208 --> 00:20:59.625
Ugh, that stinks!

00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:02.250
Kill them, Bodhisattva Eye!

00:21:08.917 --> 00:21:10.708
You're here too, Yukino?!

00:21:10.708 --> 00:21:11.542
It's all right!

00:21:11.542 --> 00:21:13.750
--We're going to get out of here quickly!
--But...

00:21:23.458 --> 00:21:27.042
Oh, damn, they ran away!

00:21:27.042 --> 00:21:30.583
Maybe it was 'cuz of that
scary face you're making?

00:21:44.625 --> 00:21:46.708
Tatsuma!

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:08.250
What the heck...?

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:10.000
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:22:11.292 --> 00:22:13.250
I couldn't protect her...

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:14.333
Huh?

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:18.958
H-Hey, Tatsuma!

00:22:18.958 --> 00:22:21.083
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:22:21.083 --> 00:22:25.583
Damn, just hang tight.
I'll take you over to the old bag's place!

00:22:28.208 --> 00:22:32.208
Will the bike carry three people though?

00:22:42.208 --> 00:22:47.333
<i>I sadly hung my head a bit</i>

00:22:47.333 --> 00:22:52.458
<i>And finally you murmured</i>

00:22:52.458 --> 00:22:56.667
<i>What I heard was a faint goodbye</i>

00:22:56.667 --> 00:23:01.625
<i>Said with all your might</i>

00:23:03.542 --> 00:23:12.875
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:12.875 --> 00:23:14.750
<i>We can see each other again</i>

00:23:14.750 --> 00:23:17.208
<i>Let's meet up again some time</i>

00:23:17.208 --> 00:23:23.000
<i>Let's each set out in search of our own futures</i>

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:27.542
<i>For the kindness you gave me for my heartache</i>

00:23:27.542 --> 00:23:31.958
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:23:33.125 --> 00:23:37.792
<i>These flower petals seem just as if</i>

00:23:37.792 --> 00:23:43.417
<i>They were blessing us as we depart on our journeys</i>

00:23:43.417 --> 00:23:47.792
<i>I won't forget your warmth</i>

00:23:47.792 --> 00:23:53.042
<i>That overwhelmed my loneliness</i>

00:23:53.042 --> 00:23:58.125
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:24:06.875 --> 00:24:07.958
"Next Episode"

00:24:10.792 --> 00:24:13.333
"Dark Arts Chapter Twelfth Night Revival of the Kozunu"

00:24:13.333 --> 00:24:17.088
"Tokyo Majin"
"Dark Arts Chapter Twelfth Night Revival of the Kozunu"
